   "description": "AI Native is the AI workforce firm for U.S. small and medium-sized businesses. It designs, installs, trains, and manages a complete AI agent workforce for every worker in every department — a Chief of Staff agent for every worker and agents for sales, customer service, bookkeeping, marketing, operations, HR, and IT — done for you, reported in the business's own numbers. Its model has four stages: the Evaluation, the Install, Management, and the Report. It serves businesses that serve people in person, sell products to people, serve other businesses, and supply other businesses, from one-person operations to companies of 500.",
